@startuml
class Calibration
class ParamsDistributions
class ParamsConfig
class Instance
class TabuSearch

class CalibrationResult {
    mean_gap: float
}

Calibration --> ParamsDistributions : amostra
ParamsDistributions ..> ParamsConfig : gera
Calibration --> Instance : avalia em
Calibration ..> TabuSearch : executa com cada\nconfiguração
Calibration ..> CalibrationResult : retorna
CalibrationResult --> ParamsConfig : configuração vencedora
@enduml
